@startuml
title Green Rides UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login
Login : entry / getInfo
Login : do / verifyData
Login : exit / verified

state LoginDecision <<choice>>
Login --> LoginDecision
state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / user selects destination
JourneyDetails : do / display journey details
JourneyDetails : exit / user chooses option

state DrivingModeChoice
DrivingModeChoice : [user chooses driving mode]
DrivingModeChoice --> DrivingMode
DrivingModeChoice : no_driving_mode : !user chooses driving mode
DrivingModeChoice --> OtherOptions

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / start driving
DrivingMode : do / drive
DrivingMode : exit / end of journey

state EatPlaceSelection
EatPlaceSelection : entry / user selects place to eat
EatPlaceSelection : do / display menu and allow order placement
EatPlaceSelection : exit / order placed or no hunger

state AccidentReporting
AccidentReporting : accident_occurs : !accident occurs
AccidentReporting : entry / inform relevant authorities
AccidentReporting : exit / report sent

state Notification
Notification : driving_or_accident : !driving or accident
Notification : entry / sending notifications
Notification : do / send notifications
Notification : exit / notifications sent

state Feedback
Feedback : journey_completed : !journey completed
Feedback : entry / allow user to provide feedback
Feedback : do / receive feedback
Feedback : exit / feedback received

JourneyDetails --> DrivingModeChoice
DrivingModeChoice --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
DrivingMode --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
EatPlaceSelection --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
AccidentReporting --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Notification --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Feedback --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
